{"is_source_file": true, "format": "C", "description": "This file contains the implementation of a bootloader component for Atheros AR7XXX/AR9XXX based boards. It includes functions for UART communication, hardware reset sequences, and specific board initializations for various hardware configurations, such as TL-WR1043ND, Meraki MR18, Huawei AP, and NEC series devices. The code interacts directly with hardware registers to perform resets, calibrations, and configurations necessary for booting embedded systems.", "external_files": ["config.h", "printf.h", "ar71xx_regs.h"], "external_methods": ["printf"], "published": ["board_putc"], "classes": [], "methods": [{"name": "void board_putc(int ch)", "description": "Sends a character over UART, waiting for the UART Transmit Holding Register to be empty before writing, and then waits again for a transmission completion.", "scope": "", "scopeKind": ""}, {"name": "void tlwr1043nd_init(void)", "description": "Initializes the TL-WR1043ND board by asserting reset on specific hardware modules via register manipulation.", "scope": "", "scopeKind": ""}, {"name": "int extract_qca955x_sgmii_res_cal(void)", "description": "Performs calibration extraction for QCA955x SGMII interface based on OTP fuse data, returning a reversed calibration value.", "scope": "", "scopeKind": ""}, {"name": "void setup_qca955x_eth_serdes_cal(unsigned int sgmii_value)", "description": "Configures the Ethernet SERDES calibration value for QCA955x chips using hardware register writes.", "scope": "", "scopeKind": ""}, {"name": "void qca955x_device_reset_clear(unsigned int mask)", "description": "Clears reset bits for QCA955x devices via register manipulation.", "scope": "", "scopeKind": ""}, {"name": "void nec_aterm_reset_common(void)", "description": "Performs common reset procedures for NEC series AR934X devices, including watchdog configuration.", "scope": "", "scopeKind": ""}, {"name": "void nec_aterm_init(void)", "description": "Performs NEC-specific ini